Bookmarklet Creation > Critical Requirements > Comment Style - ABSOLUTE

### Comment Style - ABSOLUTE
**Use ONLY `/* */` comments. NEVER use `//` comments. ** Bookmark execution contexts fail with `//` style. Every comment must use block format. ```javascript
/* ✓ Correct */
const x = 5; /* inline */ /* ✗ Wrong - breaks bookmarklets */
// const x = 5;
const y = 10; // inline
```

