All bookmarklets must wrap in IIFE: ```javascript
(function() {
  /* bookmarklet code */
})();
```

Bookmarklet Creation > Critical Requirements > Protocol Prefix

### Protocol Prefix
All delivered bookmarklets must begin with `javascript:` protocol: ```javascript
javascript:(function() {
  /* bookmarklet code */
})();
``` This makes the code immediately usable without requiring manual modification during installation.

